{"id":"0cb6343156d01ef0","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-settheoretic-modal-logics.md","title":"The Set-Theoretic Logics I and J","display":"df-settheoretic-modal-logics — The Set-Theoretic Logics I and J","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-settheoretic-modal-logics","aliases":["89-df-settheoretic-modal-logics"],"display":"df-settheoretic-modal-logics — The Set-Theoretic Logics I and J","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-df-modal-formula]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-settheoretic-modal-logics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-settheoretic-modal-logics</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-settheoretic-modal-logics — The Set-Theoretic Logics I and J"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(E\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 是原定理集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NExt}(\\mathrm{GL},E)\">\\(\\mathrm{NExt}(\\mathrm{GL},E)\\)</span> 仅取原约定的 MP 与必然化闭包；对于下面 I、J，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 已包含所列模式的全部替换实例，不额外更改闭包规则。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}settheoretic\\text{-}modal\\text{-}logics}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{NExt}(\\mathrm{GL},E)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\mid\n\\mathrm{GL}\\cup E\\subseteq X,\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}((A\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X)\\to B\\in X),\\quad\n\\forall A\\in X\\ \\Box A\\in X\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm I&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{NExt}(\\mathrm{GL},\n\\{\\Box(\\Box A\\to\\Box B)\\lor\\Box(\\Box B\\to\\Box A)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm J&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{NExt}(\\mathrm{GL},\n\\{\\Box(\\Box A\\to B)\\lor\\Box(\\Box B\\to A)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}settheoretic\\text{-}modal\\text{-}logics}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{NExt}(\\mathrm{GL},E)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\mid\n\\mathrm{GL}\\cup E\\subseteq X,\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}((A\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X)\\to B\\in X),\\quad\n\\forall A\\in X\\ \\Box A\\in X\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm I&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{NExt}(\\mathrm{GL},\n\\{\\Box(\\Box A\\to\\Box B)\\lor\\Box(\\Box B\\to\\Box A)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm J&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{NExt}(\\mathrm{GL},\n\\{\\Box(\\Box A\\to B)\\lor\\Box(\\Box B\\to A)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 13 章，印刷页 167,173–175；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n两种模式不能混写：I 两边的后件仍带盒，J 的后件不带盒。I 对应有限严格预良序层；J 对应有限严格线性序。这里用 I、J 作本书符号，不与其他多模态系统同名字母自动识别。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"E\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NExt}(\\mathrm{GL},E)","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}settheoretic\\text{-}modal\\text{-}logics}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{NExt}(\\mathrm{GL},E)&\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\mid\n\\mathrm{GL}\\cup E\\subseteq X,\\\\\n&\\qquad\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}((A\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X)\\to B\\in X),\\quad\n\\forall A\\in X\\ \\Box A\\in X\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm I&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{NExt}(\\mathrm{GL},\n\\{\\Box(\\Box A\\to\\Box B)\\lor\\Box(\\Box B\\to\\Box A)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm J&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{NExt}(\\mathrm{GL},\n\\{\\Box(\\Box A\\to B)\\lor\\Box(\\Box B\\to A)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1714,"backlinks":[{"id":"a0adb8444eeba120","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-55","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-settheoretic-modal-logics]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-166","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-finite-prewellorder]] → [[89-df-settheoretic-modal-logics]] → [[89-df-settheoretic-realization]] → [[89-thm-settheoretic-completeness]]"}],"outgoing":["0006800fa1c85177","56c1b5b75a32ca1d"]}